---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import FormFields from '../components/FormFields.astro';
import FormScript from '../components/FormScript.astro';
import {products} from '../data/products';
const preselect = Astro.url.searchParams.get('product');
---
<Layout title="Buy Now — Request Your First Batch" description="Send Two Spoons an order request for our developing cookies, banana bread, and seasoning blends. No payment collected; we’ll confirm products, prices, and availability with you."><div class="container"><header class="page-intro order-intro"><span class="eyebrow">SOMETHING GOOD FOR YOUR TABLE</span><h1>Let’s fill <em>your pantry.</em></h1><p>Tell us what you’d love. We’ll confirm the final products, prices, and timing with you before your order is final. No payment is collected here.</p></header>
<form class="order-layout" data-kind="orders" method="post" action="/api/orders"><div><div class="order-title"><h2>What sounds good?</h2><span data-item-count aria-live="polite">{preselect ? '1 item selected':'0 items selected'}</span></div><div class="order-products">{products.map(product=><div class="order-product"><img src={product.image} alt="" width="82" height="82"/><div><h2><a href={`/pantry/${product.slug}`}>{product.name}</a></h2><p>In development · Details to be confirmed</p></div><div class="quantity"><button type="button" data-change="-1" data-for={`qty-${product.slug}`} aria-label={`Decrease ${product.name.toLowerCase()} quantity`}>−</button><input type="number" min="0" max="20" step="1" value={preselect===product.slug?1:0} id={`qty-${product.slug}`} data-product-quantity={product.slug} aria-label={`${product.name} quantity`}/><button type="button" data-change="1" data-for={`qty-${product.slug}`} aria-label={`Increase ${product.name.toLowerCase()} quantity`}>+</button></div></div>)}</div><p class="order-clarification">Quantities indicate your interest. Final recipes, package sizes, ingredients, allergens, and pricing will be confirmed before purchase.</p>
  <div class="form-panel"><h2>A few details, please.</h2><p>So we can get in touch about your request.</p><FormFields prefix="order"/><div class="field"><label for="order-phone">Phone number <span>(optional)</span></label><input id="order-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="40" placeholder="For coordinating your request"/></div><fieldset><legend>How would you like to receive your order?</legend><div class="fulfillment-options"><label><input name="fulfillment" type="radio" value="pickup" checked/>Haymarket-area pickup</label><label><input name="fulfillment" type="radio" value="delivery"/>Virginia delivery</label></div></fieldset><fieldset data-delivery-fields hidden disabled><legend>Delivery address <span style="font-weight:400">(Virginia only)</span></legend><div class="field"><label for="address1">Street address</label><input id="address1" name="address1" autocomplete="address-line1" required maxlength="200"/></div><div class="field"><label for="address2">Apartment or suite <span>(optional)</span></label><input id="address2" name="address2" autocomplete="address-line2" maxlength="200"/></div><div class="field-grid"><div class="field"><label for="city">City</label><input id="city" name="city" autocomplete="address-level2" required maxlength="100"/></div><div class="field"><label for="state">State</label><select id="state" name="state" autocomplete="address-level1"><option value="VA">Virginia</option></select></div></div><div class="field"><label for="postalCode">ZIP code</label><input id="postalCode" name="postalCode" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="postal-code" pattern="[0-9]{5}(-[0-9]{4})?" required maxlength="10" placeholder="20164"/></div><p class="form-fineprint" style="margin:0 0 20px">Delivery availability, timing, and any delivery cost will be confirmed with you.</p></fieldset><div class="field"><label for="order-notes">Anything else? <span>(optional)</span></label><textarea id="order-notes" name="notes" maxlength="2000" rows="3" placeholder="Product preferences, a question, or the best way to reach you…"></textarea></div><label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" required/><span>I understand this is an order request, with availability, product details, and pricing to be confirmed. Two Spoons may contact me about it. I’ve read the <a href="/privacy">privacy notice</a>.</span></label><label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="newsletter"/><span>Also sign me up for the Two Spoons newsletter. Kitchen stories and first-batch news sound good!</span></label><button class="button" type="submit">Send my order request <Icon size={18}/></button><p class="form-fineprint">No charge. No card details. We’ll confirm everything with you first.</p><div class="form-message" data-form-message role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1" hidden></div><noscript><p class="form-message error">Please enable JavaScript to select products and submit your request.</p></noscript></div>
</div><aside class="order-summary" aria-label="Order request summary"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE GOODNESS, COMING TOGETHER</span><h2>Your pantry picks.</h2><p data-summary-empty class="summary-empty">Your next happy bite starts here. Add something that sounds good.</p><ul class="summary-items" data-summary-items aria-live="polite" hidden></ul><div class="summary-price">PRICING<strong>Confirmed with you.</strong></div><p>We’re still preparing our first lineup. This request starts a conversation and does not reserve stock or create a paid order.</p><ol class="step-list"><li>Tell us what you’re interested in.</li><li>We confirm products, prices, and timing.</li><li>You decide if you’d like to go ahead.</li></ol></aside></form></div><FormScript/></Layout>
